  "description": "Community (free) edition of sgcEditors .NET: all 17 input controls (month calendar, date, time and date time pickers, range slider, rating, spin edit, colour picker, token edit, currency, mask, button, lookup and search edits, memo, check group and radio group), the layout control and the property grid in WinForms, WPF and Avalonia, with themes, keyboard, DPI and headless PNG and SVG output. Free for both commercial and non-commercial use by small teams (individuals and organizations under EUR 1M annual gross revenue and no more than 5 developers); organizations at or above either threshold need a Commercial licence. The HSV and alpha parts of the colour picker, the token auto-complete list, the two thumb range slider, the multi-object selection of the property grid and the data form are not included in the Community edition (the property grid inspects one object at a time). https://www.esegece.com",
